text Naranja_CharicificValley_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_08176E92 {
    "I think POKéMON get closer to their\nTRAINERS if they spend time together.\pThe longer the better.\nThat’s what I think."
}

text Naranja_CharicificValley_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_08176F08 {
    "I gave a RED オカキクケ to my POKéMON.\nIt looks a lot cooler all of a sudden.\pHmm...\nMaybe I ought to eat a RED オカキクケ."
}

text Naranja_CharicificValley_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_08176F7A {
    "Hohoho! Hey, kid, you can reach\nthe hot springs from here.\pIf POKéMON are getting rest, so too\nshould their TRAINERS."
